WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:38.200
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:38.280 --> 01:40.840
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

01:49.840 --> 01:50.920
I asked around.

01:51.000 --> 01:52.760
Up ahead is Changyue Lane,

01:52.840 --> 01:54.520
where mortals drink flower wine.

01:54.600 --> 01:56.240
Since we want to be mortals,

01:56.320 --> 01:58.680
we can't miss this fun activity.

02:00.080 --> 02:01.560
What does drinking flower wine mean?

02:03.280 --> 02:05.280
The flower refers to a woman.

02:05.960 --> 02:06.880
Drinking flower wine

02:06.960 --> 02:08.199
means going to a brothel

02:08.280 --> 02:09.479
and finding a beautiful lady

02:09.560 --> 02:12.160
to sing for and entertain us.

02:14.080 --> 02:16.960
I don't think it's a good idea.

02:17.040 --> 02:18.880
Indulging in pleasure will bungle matters.

02:18.960 --> 02:19.960
Bungle matters?

02:20.040 --> 02:21.320
What matters?

02:22.400 --> 02:24.480
We came to Lucheng for relaxation.

02:25.280 --> 02:26.400
Didn't we?

02:27.840 --> 02:28.680
That's right.

02:29.520 --> 02:30.560
Exactly.

02:33.160 --> 02:35.360
See? The master has given the order.

02:35.920 --> 02:39.120
Our top priority today is to have fun.

02:39.200 --> 02:41.440
We're drinking our way
down the street today.

02:41.520 --> 02:43.000
Let's get hammered!

02:43.640 --> 02:44.840
Guests, please head on in.

02:44.920 --> 02:46.280
Please come in.

02:49.320 --> 02:50.800
Please come in.

02:52.440 --> 02:53.800
Please come in.

02:58.640 --> 02:59.760
- Please enter.
- Bravo.

03:02.400 --> 03:03.400
Let's go over there.

03:03.480 --> 03:05.800
- Go over there.
- Please come in.

03:08.760 --> 03:09.680
Sir.

03:10.440 --> 03:11.400
What is this place?

03:11.920 --> 03:14.720
This is Flying Immortal Pavilion,
where Lady Wanqing lives.

03:14.800 --> 03:15.960
Don't you know?

03:16.040 --> 03:18.120
We just arrived in Lucheng.

03:18.200 --> 03:20.000
Who is Lady Wanqing?

03:20.080 --> 03:21.880
She is the most beautiful courtesan

03:21.960 --> 03:23.440
on Changyue Lane in Lucheng.

03:23.520 --> 03:25.640
Her mastery of the Six Arts
is unmatched in the world.

03:25.720 --> 03:27.040
She is even

03:27.120 --> 03:29.800
as beautiful as the fairies in heaven.

03:30.680 --> 03:32.320
No, she is even more beautiful.

03:32.400 --> 03:34.120
Have you seen

03:34.200 --> 03:35.640
the fairies in heaven?

03:35.720 --> 03:37.040
I'm not talking nonsense.

03:37.120 --> 03:38.840
Lady Wanqing came to Changyue Lane

03:38.920 --> 03:40.560
at the age of 15.

03:40.640 --> 03:42.480
Her magnificent dance

03:42.560 --> 03:44.080
made a hundred flowers bloom.

03:44.160 --> 03:45.480
Word of it spread all over Lucheng.

03:45.560 --> 03:46.800
Even the children knew.

03:47.360 --> 03:48.560
It sounds like

03:48.640 --> 03:51.720
Lady Wanqing is indeed
a reincarnation of a fairy.

03:54.520 --> 03:55.520
But now,

03:56.080 --> 03:58.720
only noble families
have the privilege of seeing Lady Wanqing.

03:59.400 --> 04:02.040
Ordinary folk like us will never see her.

04:02.640 --> 04:05.320
If I'm lucky enough
to see her dance again,

04:05.400 --> 04:07.760
I shall die without regret.

04:07.840 --> 04:09.920
In that case, I am determined

04:10.000 --> 04:11.680
to meet her today.

04:12.960 --> 04:13.800
Look.

04:13.880 --> 04:16.399
That is Lady Wanqing's floral invitation.

04:16.480 --> 04:17.519
Only by having that

04:17.600 --> 04:19.360
can you enter Flying Immortal Pavilion.

04:29.760 --> 04:30.960
Young man, please halt.

04:32.320 --> 04:35.000
We heard that Lady Wanqing
is versatile and gorgeous.

04:35.080 --> 04:36.360
We came from afar to visit her.

04:36.440 --> 04:37.960
Do you have a floral invitation?

04:38.520 --> 04:39.880
No.

04:39.960 --> 04:41.240
But will this be enough

04:41.320 --> 04:43.240
to meet Lady Wanqing?

04:43.320 --> 04:45.440
You underestimate our lady.

04:53.280 --> 04:55.320
Flying Immortal Pavilion has its rules.

04:55.880 --> 04:58.040
Please don't make my job difficult.

05:00.240 --> 05:01.800
That's too much.

05:01.880 --> 05:02.920
You're giving too much.

05:10.880 --> 05:11.920
Please come in.

05:12.000 --> 05:13.520
- Please enter.
- Please enter.

05:13.600 --> 05:17.960
TOO ELATED TO WORRY

05:25.280 --> 05:26.920
- Welcome, sir.
- Sir, please drink slowly.

05:27.720 --> 05:29.680
- Nice to meet you.
- I'll pour you another glass.

05:32.160 --> 05:33.000
Sir.

05:33.560 --> 05:34.760
You're a sweet talker.

05:35.480 --> 05:36.720
Come.

05:37.960 --> 05:40.040
- Come on.
- You are here too.

05:40.120 --> 05:41.640
Lord Changheng?

05:41.720 --> 05:43.760
Why is he in Lucheng too?

05:43.840 --> 05:46.360
No. I don't detect
an Immortal Pond in him.

05:46.440 --> 05:47.720
He seems to be a mortal.

05:47.800 --> 05:50.200
Why does he look
exactly like Lord Changheng?

05:52.320 --> 05:53.960
A Magical Firefly Stone?

05:54.040 --> 05:55.800
He is Lord Changheng.

05:55.880 --> 05:58.600
Is he also experiencing tribulations
in the Mortal World?

05:58.680 --> 06:00.120
- Come.
- This is bad.

06:00.200 --> 06:01.760
If Dongfang Qingcang finds out,

06:01.840 --> 06:03.040
he will kill him,

06:03.120 --> 06:04.360
making him fail his tribulation

06:04.440 --> 06:05.760
and he'll dissipate.

06:05.840 --> 06:07.280
Mr. Dongfang!

06:07.360 --> 06:08.440
Mr. Dongfang.

06:09.400 --> 06:11.160
Why don't we sit here?

06:11.720 --> 06:12.800
We can have a clearer view here.

06:50.400 --> 06:51.640
Lady Wanqing is coming.

06:52.560 --> 06:53.560
- Hurry.
- Come on.

06:53.640 --> 06:55.680
- Let's go and see.
- Let's go and have a look.

06:58.960 --> 07:00.520
- Goodness.
- Yes.

07:01.120 --> 07:02.480
It's her.

07:02.560 --> 07:03.520
It's starting.

08:15.280 --> 08:17.600
Why is there a Hellfire mark
on Xie Wanqing?

08:18.320 --> 08:19.840
Thirty thousand years of tribulations.

08:19.920 --> 08:22.440
The high immortal who was injured
by Hellfire 30,000 years ago.

08:22.520 --> 08:24.680
Xie Wanqing is the reincarnation
of the former God of War.

08:30.680 --> 08:33.360
It seems he already knew.

08:33.840 --> 08:36.120
What does he want to do

08:36.200 --> 08:37.600
with her primordial spirit?

08:38.640 --> 08:40.320
No matter what he wants to do,

08:40.400 --> 08:41.840
I must stop him

08:41.919 --> 08:43.520
and protect the former God of War.

08:55.720 --> 08:58.360
This dance is so beautiful.

08:59.440 --> 09:00.960
But you seem absent-minded.

09:01.600 --> 09:03.080
Something seems to be on your mind.

09:04.440 --> 09:06.000
There isn't.

09:17.880 --> 09:19.160
What kind of dance is this?

09:19.240 --> 09:20.200
It's so beautiful.

09:22.000 --> 09:23.200
What about you?

09:24.160 --> 09:25.320
Would you like to tell me

09:26.640 --> 09:28.120
what is on your mind?

09:48.800 --> 09:49.920
I…

09:50.000 --> 09:51.520
Bravo!

09:53.080 --> 09:54.240
Bravo!

09:55.400 --> 09:56.320
What's wrong?

09:59.560 --> 10:02.800
I think I ate something bad today.

10:06.680 --> 10:07.680
Do you have a stomachache?

10:20.280 --> 10:21.600
I was wondering who it was.

10:21.680 --> 10:23.360
- It's the devil incarnate.
- Yes.

10:23.440 --> 10:24.480
Who is he?

10:24.960 --> 10:27.120
Xiao Run,
the second son of the Xiao family.

10:27.200 --> 10:29.120
He's the top playboy in Lucheng.

10:29.200 --> 10:30.160
He is ignorant

10:30.240 --> 10:31.840
and indulges in pleasure all day.

10:31.920 --> 10:34.280
He isn't qualified to be here.

10:34.360 --> 10:35.560
Uncouth as he is,

10:35.640 --> 10:37.120
he can only crassly shout praises.

10:37.200 --> 10:38.480
How can he understand

10:38.560 --> 10:39.880
the intricacies of the dance?

10:41.760 --> 10:42.680
So

10:43.360 --> 10:45.320
Lord Changheng is called Xiao Run

10:45.400 --> 10:46.560
in this life.

10:54.120 --> 10:56.560
Mr. Wang presents Lady Wanqing

10:56.640 --> 10:58.920
with 5,000 taels of gold!

10:59.720 --> 11:01.480
Five thousand taels.

11:01.560 --> 11:03.560
Mr. Su of Cloud Weaving Atelier presents

11:03.640 --> 11:05.640
ten rolls of light cyan fabric,

11:06.200 --> 11:07.800
ten rolls of cloud-patterned brocade,

11:07.880 --> 11:09.680
and ten rolls
of landscape-patterned brocade.

11:10.240 --> 11:13.040
Minister Li from the Ministry of Revenue
presents a case of jewelry.

11:13.120 --> 11:14.360
Jieli, what are you doing?

11:14.440 --> 11:15.560
Why are you so excited?

11:16.800 --> 11:18.440
It's money, Orchid.

11:19.000 --> 11:21.160
Do you know how much those are worth?

11:22.920 --> 11:24.880
Do you have any use
for money in the Mortal World?

11:24.960 --> 11:26.120
Of course.

11:27.000 --> 11:28.760
When I look at gold and jewelry,

11:28.840 --> 11:32.440
I feel bright-eyed and refreshed.

11:33.120 --> 11:34.920
I would sleep incredibly soundly

11:35.000 --> 11:36.800
on a bed of gold.

11:38.000 --> 11:42.000
Mr. Xiao presents an imperial...

11:42.080 --> 11:44.200
An imperial gift of a red coral tree!

11:44.280 --> 11:46.160
- Imperial gift?
- Is there such a thing?

11:46.240 --> 11:48.000
- Amazing.
- Goodness.

11:48.080 --> 11:49.320
How lucky.

11:50.560 --> 11:51.680
An imperial gift?

11:52.560 --> 11:53.760
An imperial gift.

11:54.400 --> 11:55.800
It's from the emperor.

11:55.880 --> 11:57.160
Do you know who that is?

11:57.240 --> 11:59.440
He is the equivalent
of the Moon Supreme in Yunmeng Lake.

12:00.160 --> 12:02.800
That is a unique and priceless treasure.

12:03.520 --> 12:05.720
Mr. Xiao presented a priceless treasure.

12:05.800 --> 12:07.240
No one can match him.

12:07.320 --> 12:10.040
So he can be Lady Wanqing's guest.

12:10.120 --> 12:12.240
I have to see

12:12.320 --> 12:13.760
who Mr. Xiao is.

12:13.840 --> 12:15.440
Mr. Xiao, this way, please.

12:17.920 --> 12:19.880
Thank you.

12:19.960 --> 12:22.560
I can't believe he can simply give away
an imperial gift.

12:23.040 --> 12:24.080
My goodness.

12:25.080 --> 12:26.480
What now?

12:26.560 --> 12:27.640
The Bone Orchid is missing.

12:27.720 --> 12:28.560
What?

12:28.640 --> 12:29.760
The Bone Orchid is missing.

12:29.840 --> 12:31.840
I was wearing it just now.

12:31.920 --> 12:33.760
I don't know why it is suddenly gone.

12:34.320 --> 12:35.280
Don't worry.

12:35.360 --> 12:36.600
The Bone Orchid obeys my orders.

12:36.680 --> 12:37.960
I will summon it now.

12:38.040 --> 12:39.040
No, don't.

12:39.680 --> 12:41.000
Don't use any powers.

12:41.080 --> 12:41.960
Have you forgotten?

12:42.040 --> 12:43.080
Mortal lives are destined.

12:43.160 --> 12:44.200
We can't disturb them.

12:44.280 --> 12:46.760
Otherwise,
these mortals will turn into ashes.

12:47.320 --> 12:49.360
Shangque, help me find it.

12:56.960 --> 12:57.800
Search.

12:59.040 --> 13:00.080
Yes.

13:07.440 --> 13:09.040
You must help me find it

13:09.120 --> 13:10.880
because Bone Orchid

13:10.960 --> 13:12.840
is priceless to me.

13:19.000 --> 13:19.960
I found it.

13:24.120 --> 13:26.080
Why exactly did you come to Yunmeng Lake?

13:27.480 --> 13:28.360
I…

13:29.680 --> 13:31.360
I'm here to accompany you.

13:39.920 --> 13:43.440
FLYING IMMORTAL PAVILION

13:46.520 --> 13:47.680
Mr. Xiao.

13:47.760 --> 13:48.880
Hi, Lady Wanqing.

13:49.840 --> 13:51.040
Who is this monkey?

13:51.120 --> 13:52.880
No descendant of the nobility in Lucheng

13:52.960 --> 13:54.840
dares to be so rude to our lady.

13:57.120 --> 13:59.320
My lady, I'm Xiao Run.

13:59.880 --> 14:02.640
We met at Xiao Mansion
when we were just children.

14:02.720 --> 14:04.520
Do you remember?

14:05.040 --> 14:05.880
No.

14:09.360 --> 14:12.880
Our fathers were classmates

14:12.960 --> 14:14.760
and also officials in the same court.

14:14.840 --> 14:17.440
The late emperor even betrothed you to me

14:17.520 --> 14:19.360
before birth.

14:19.440 --> 14:20.960
Do you remember this?

14:22.840 --> 14:23.680
Ten years ago,

14:23.760 --> 14:25.360
my father fell victim to a political feud.

14:25.440 --> 14:27.160
In the Xie family,

14:27.240 --> 14:29.760
men were exiled
to the harsh northern frontiers

14:29.840 --> 14:32.520
and women were forced
to be courtesans in the Royal Academy.

14:34.080 --> 14:36.000
I'm a convicted person.

14:36.080 --> 14:37.880
You need not mention

14:37.960 --> 14:39.240
our engagement ever again.

14:42.160 --> 14:45.040
My lady, you're wrong.

14:45.120 --> 14:48.080
Although the Xiao family
and Xie family have changed,

14:48.160 --> 14:49.920
a gentleman must keep his promise.

14:50.920 --> 14:52.120
Since we are engaged,

14:52.200 --> 14:53.280
I can't break my promise.

14:54.080 --> 14:57.720
I came with an imperial gift
of a red coral tree

14:57.800 --> 14:58.840
to propose to you today.

15:00.160 --> 15:01.600
Wanqing.

15:04.160 --> 15:05.480
Why don't you agree

15:05.560 --> 15:07.200
to such a good marriage?

15:07.280 --> 15:08.360
His father

15:08.440 --> 15:10.200
has a successful official career.

15:10.760 --> 15:12.960
His brother is a top scholar

15:13.040 --> 15:14.760
and highly favored by the emperor.

15:15.400 --> 15:17.480
You're lucky
to receive this offer from Xiao Run.

15:18.240 --> 15:19.680
If you say yes,

15:19.760 --> 15:22.560
you will enjoy a life of luxury.

15:22.640 --> 15:24.880
Must I say yes just because he wants me?

15:25.720 --> 15:28.120
This playboy wants
to play this game of courtship,

15:28.200 --> 15:29.400
but he doesn't know

15:29.480 --> 15:31.440
that my heart has never been in this game.

15:32.440 --> 15:34.120
I'm not like him.

15:34.200 --> 15:35.240
Wanqing,

15:35.720 --> 15:37.240
given your current status,

15:37.320 --> 15:39.120
how can you still be so picky

15:39.200 --> 15:40.400
like a daughter of nobility?

15:40.480 --> 15:42.880
Forget about a wealthy family
like the Xiaos.

15:42.960 --> 15:45.000
You won't even get to be an official wife

15:45.080 --> 15:47.320
in any respectable family.

15:47.400 --> 15:48.640
Listen to me.

15:49.600 --> 15:50.920
You're not young anymore.

15:51.920 --> 15:53.320
I've gone through this.

15:53.880 --> 15:55.280
In this field,

15:55.360 --> 15:57.480
everyone prefers the new over the old.

15:57.560 --> 15:59.640
Others consider this a great favor.

15:59.720 --> 16:00.800
But in my opinion,

16:00.880 --> 16:02.640
I will just be living in another cage.

16:05.800 --> 16:06.680
Tongyun.

16:12.400 --> 16:13.480
Mr. Xiao,

16:14.160 --> 16:16.520
this cup of tea
is all that will come of us.

16:17.480 --> 16:19.440
I thank you for your favor.

16:19.520 --> 16:20.440
Please leave.

16:40.720 --> 16:42.480
Since you don't want to say yes today,

16:42.560 --> 16:44.600
I'll come another day.

16:46.080 --> 16:47.080
This man.

16:47.160 --> 16:48.040
Mr. Xiao.

16:48.120 --> 16:49.840
My lady brewed this tea herself.

16:49.920 --> 16:51.520
He just gulped it down.

16:51.600 --> 16:53.080
He really is uncouth.

16:53.160 --> 16:54.000
Tongyun.

16:54.560 --> 16:57.440
Return the imperial red coral tree
to Mr. Xiao.

17:00.960 --> 17:02.560
My dear.

17:02.640 --> 17:03.920
Go now.

17:05.119 --> 17:06.960
If you really refuse this marriage,

17:07.040 --> 17:08.200
you will…

17:08.280 --> 17:09.359
Don't worry, Madam.

17:09.440 --> 17:10.839
I have my own plan.

17:11.440 --> 17:14.200
I already have the best choice in mind.

17:14.280 --> 17:15.720
Is there anyone

17:15.800 --> 17:17.920
better than wealthy Mr. Xiao
that wants to marry you?

17:23.680 --> 17:26.640
- Move. I need to see Mr. Xiao.
- Cricket? Why are you here?

17:26.720 --> 17:28.560
I told you to stay home to do my homework.

17:28.640 --> 17:30.640
Bad news. Master found out.

17:30.720 --> 17:32.520
He lost his temper in the study.

17:32.600 --> 17:33.920
He broke three teacups.

17:34.960 --> 17:36.360
I've skipped lessons before.

17:36.440 --> 17:37.400
Take it easy.

17:37.480 --> 17:39.240
No, it's because of the coral tree.

17:39.320 --> 17:40.320
Come on, let's go.

17:48.760 --> 17:49.640
Be careful.

17:50.120 --> 17:51.880
Let's go. Hurry up.

18:02.520 --> 18:03.800
Once they're gone,

18:03.880 --> 18:04.840
sneak into the backyard

18:04.920 --> 18:06.160
and get Grandmother to save me.

18:06.880 --> 18:08.720
Don't be so clumsy. Be careful.

18:09.480 --> 18:11.040
If my father finds out,

18:11.120 --> 18:12.120
he will kill me.

18:14.200 --> 18:15.360
Do you hear me?

18:24.080 --> 18:24.920
Father.

18:31.400 --> 18:32.320
Beat him.

18:33.880 --> 18:35.240
Gambling and soliciting courtesans.

18:35.320 --> 18:36.680
That's all fine.

18:37.240 --> 18:38.400
Bastard.

18:38.480 --> 18:41.240
Today, you even stole the coral tree
that the emperor bestowed upon me

18:41.320 --> 18:43.600
to solicit those in the pleasure district!

18:43.680 --> 18:45.360
Father, let me explain.

18:45.440 --> 18:47.440
The coral tree sits there daily

18:47.520 --> 18:48.920
and you worship it day and night.

18:49.000 --> 18:50.000
If you continue like that,

18:50.080 --> 18:51.760
you won't be able to straighten your back!

18:51.840 --> 18:53.480
Father, I'm just worried about you.

18:54.320 --> 18:55.840
Stop quibbling.

18:57.640 --> 18:58.800
Father,

18:58.880 --> 19:01.000
Lady Wanqing has returned the coral tree.

19:03.480 --> 19:04.600
How many strikes has it been?

19:05.320 --> 19:06.880
Master, more than 30 times.

19:06.960 --> 19:08.080
Get up!

19:08.880 --> 19:09.840
Go to bed.

19:10.400 --> 19:11.800
Go to school tomorrow morning.

19:12.360 --> 19:14.400
- Be careful.
- Lady Wanqing?

19:14.480 --> 19:16.440
She's just a courtesan.

19:17.680 --> 19:19.840
Father, you can't say that.

19:19.920 --> 19:20.800
Don't say it.

19:21.920 --> 19:23.320
My engagement with her

19:23.400 --> 19:24.680
was arranged by the late emperor.

19:25.480 --> 19:27.200
If I don't fulfill this promise,

19:27.280 --> 19:28.960
I'll be committing high treason.

19:30.280 --> 19:31.400
Bastard!

19:32.280 --> 19:33.240
The late emperor

19:33.320 --> 19:34.840
had merely joked about the engagement.

19:34.920 --> 19:36.440
If you truly do marry her,

19:36.520 --> 19:38.320
the Xiao family

19:38.400 --> 19:40.480
will become a laughingstock in Lucheng!

19:40.560 --> 19:42.800
If everyone in Lucheng learns

19:42.880 --> 19:44.400
that the Xiao family are utter snobs

19:44.480 --> 19:46.280
who judge others based on their status,

19:46.360 --> 19:47.720
then we'll really be a laughingstock.

19:48.280 --> 19:49.840
Every single thing I do

19:49.920 --> 19:51.840
is for our family.

19:52.600 --> 19:53.520
In this world,

19:53.600 --> 19:55.720
you can't find a son
as loyal and filial as me.

19:57.960 --> 19:58.880
Father,

19:59.480 --> 20:00.760
you always taught me

20:00.840 --> 20:02.000
to read the books of sages

20:02.560 --> 20:04.200
and become a scholar like my brother.

20:04.280 --> 20:05.760
If I were to be like you,

20:05.840 --> 20:08.640
well-read yet so hypocritical,

20:09.480 --> 20:11.600
I would rather be an illiterate commoner!

20:15.640 --> 20:17.400
Unfilial son!

20:17.480 --> 20:18.920
- Come here.
- Master, calm down.

20:19.000 --> 20:20.520
- Hit me. I'm tough.
- Come here.

20:20.600 --> 20:22.080
- You won't feel sorry.
- I'll kill you.

20:22.160 --> 20:23.960
Come here. Father.

20:24.040 --> 20:25.920
You two are really close.

20:26.000 --> 20:27.280
If you both want to be punished,

20:27.360 --> 20:28.440
I'll grant you your wish!

20:28.520 --> 20:30.240
As a man, I'll answer for my actions.

20:30.320 --> 20:31.960
Don't hit Cricket.

20:32.040 --> 20:33.120
You have an iron backbone.

20:33.680 --> 20:34.560
From now on,

20:35.120 --> 20:37.440
you won't get a monthly allowance anymore!

20:39.000 --> 20:39.880
Father, I was wrong.

21:02.080 --> 21:03.200
Xiao Run,

21:04.040 --> 21:05.360
letting your father scold you

21:05.440 --> 21:06.720
wouldn't cost you anything.

21:07.200 --> 21:09.840
Why did you say that nonsense

21:09.920 --> 21:11.320
and anger your father?

21:13.560 --> 21:14.960
My father

21:15.040 --> 21:17.240
is always full of hypocritical words.

21:17.320 --> 21:18.480
Look.

21:18.560 --> 21:20.120
He showed his true colors, didn't he?

21:23.000 --> 21:24.120
Xiao Run,

21:24.640 --> 21:26.760
do you really want to marry Lady Wanqing?

21:27.680 --> 21:28.960
You don't even like her.

21:34.080 --> 21:36.160
She is noble-minded and elegant.

21:37.400 --> 21:39.760
The brothel hasn't changed her nature.

21:40.600 --> 21:42.000
She is a hero among women.

21:42.680 --> 21:45.600
I don't have romantic feelings for her,

21:46.520 --> 21:48.320
but I do feel fondness as a friend.

21:49.040 --> 21:50.080
If she agrees,

21:50.720 --> 21:53.000
I will treat her well in the future.

21:56.240 --> 21:57.200
Besides…

22:02.600 --> 22:04.160
Ever since I was young,

22:04.240 --> 22:07.000
I've kept dreaming of a fairy.

22:07.080 --> 22:09.040
She has an ethereal quality,

22:09.120 --> 22:10.640
like an orchid in a remote valley.

22:10.720 --> 22:13.600
She bears similarities to Lady Wanqing.

22:15.280 --> 22:16.480
Do you think

22:16.560 --> 22:18.240
Lady Wanqing and I are destined

22:18.320 --> 22:19.480
to be married?

22:19.560 --> 22:23.440
FLYING IMMORTAL PAVILION

22:24.720 --> 22:26.640
- Take care.
- Take care.

22:26.720 --> 22:27.760
Be careful.

22:30.520 --> 22:31.440
Sir, take care.

22:34.600 --> 22:36.480
What's wrong? Are you still drunk?

22:37.360 --> 22:39.240
No, it's nothing.

22:39.320 --> 22:41.000
After walking all day

22:41.080 --> 22:43.080
without flying,

22:43.160 --> 22:44.560
my legs are sore.

22:44.640 --> 22:46.320
It's not easy to be a mortal.

22:46.960 --> 22:47.880
Why don't I carry you?

22:50.040 --> 22:51.480
No, thank you.

22:51.560 --> 22:53.160
I'm not tired all of a sudden.

22:53.240 --> 22:54.400
It's true.

23:03.720 --> 23:04.600
Jieli.

23:06.040 --> 23:07.400
What are you doing?

23:07.480 --> 23:09.160
My dear Shangque,

23:09.240 --> 23:10.760
I'm tired too.

23:21.800 --> 23:23.720
Carry me too.

23:29.840 --> 23:32.280
Shangque, why are you running?

23:34.880 --> 23:35.960
- By the way--
- By the way--

23:40.800 --> 23:41.680
You go first.

23:42.480 --> 23:43.480
You first.

23:49.840 --> 23:51.160
You said

23:52.040 --> 23:53.800
that there is no love between us.

23:54.400 --> 23:56.320
Then why did you say

23:56.400 --> 23:59.040
that Bone Orchid is priceless to you?

24:01.280 --> 24:02.400
Well…

24:02.960 --> 24:04.720
Are you lying to me?

24:09.200 --> 24:10.120
No.

24:10.200 --> 24:11.160
Then

24:12.640 --> 24:14.200
did you lie

24:14.280 --> 24:15.520
that there is no love between us?

24:16.280 --> 24:17.280
No.

24:23.120 --> 24:24.240
In the future,

24:24.960 --> 24:26.600
if you do attack Shuiyuntian

24:27.080 --> 24:28.440
and kill the fairies,

24:29.840 --> 24:31.000
you will be my enemy.

24:45.040 --> 24:46.040
Then

24:46.520 --> 24:47.960
what were you trying to say just now?

24:48.640 --> 24:49.520
You…

24:50.440 --> 24:52.040
Are you really not angry with me?

24:54.240 --> 24:55.120
Angry?

24:55.200 --> 24:56.280
In the past,

24:56.360 --> 24:57.960
if I had said or done something

24:58.040 --> 24:59.600
to disobey you,

25:00.200 --> 25:01.920
you would have been angry with me

25:02.000 --> 25:03.120
and lost your temper.

25:04.640 --> 25:06.320
"I will kill you."

25:10.960 --> 25:14.400
Is that how I used to treat you?

25:15.600 --> 25:16.560
Yes.

25:17.280 --> 25:18.640
But these days,

25:19.640 --> 25:21.520
I've said things you don't like,

25:21.600 --> 25:22.680
managed you,

25:23.240 --> 25:24.560
and even lost the Bone Orchid.

25:25.160 --> 25:26.720
But you haven't been like before.

25:29.720 --> 25:31.800
Are you really not mad at me?

26:04.360 --> 26:05.200
My lord,

26:06.120 --> 26:07.120
what is on your mind?

26:07.760 --> 26:09.720
You've been sitting here

26:09.800 --> 26:10.720
since you came back.

26:12.280 --> 26:13.520
Do you think

26:14.080 --> 26:16.040
I have been abnormal lately?

26:18.240 --> 26:19.920
You've always been wise.

26:20.000 --> 26:21.080
Nothing is abnormal.

26:21.160 --> 26:22.240
Not that.

26:25.080 --> 26:27.120
I've been distracted recently.

26:27.200 --> 26:28.640
I can't concentrate.

26:28.720 --> 26:30.640
Especially when it comes to Orchid.

26:31.520 --> 26:33.320
Sometimes, I should be angry,

26:33.880 --> 26:35.400
but I can't get angry.

26:36.440 --> 26:38.360
I even hope she will make me angry.

26:39.480 --> 26:40.480
But she…

26:49.160 --> 26:51.320
She always used to talk my ear off.

26:52.520 --> 26:53.560
But now,

26:54.080 --> 26:57.000
she doesn't want
to spend a single second with me.

26:58.000 --> 26:59.480
It has become quiet.

27:00.320 --> 27:01.760
Yet I feel…

27:03.160 --> 27:04.080
Tell me.

27:04.560 --> 27:05.680
What is the matter with me?

27:09.240 --> 27:11.000
Now that you bring it up--

27:11.080 --> 27:12.280
Orchid!

27:12.360 --> 27:13.680
Orchid, wait for me!

27:16.440 --> 27:17.360
Orchid!

27:23.720 --> 27:25.480
I have had the same symptoms recently.

27:26.840 --> 27:28.000
But I don't know

27:28.680 --> 27:30.320
the specific reason.

27:41.280 --> 27:42.520
What?

27:42.600 --> 27:44.040
Xiao Run is Lord Changheng?

27:45.640 --> 27:47.120
Quiet down.

27:48.640 --> 27:51.240
Do you mean the Lord Changheng
that you are always talking about?

27:52.960 --> 27:55.480
Currently, Lord Changheng
is going through tribulation.

27:55.560 --> 27:56.600
Do you remember?

27:56.680 --> 27:59.680
You once asked me
about a high god's tribulation.

27:59.760 --> 28:00.640
Yes.

28:00.720 --> 28:02.880
You said that it is fraught with dangers.

28:02.960 --> 28:04.600
If they fail to complete the tribulation,

28:04.680 --> 28:05.680
they will dissipate.

28:05.760 --> 28:06.920
That's right.

28:07.000 --> 28:09.480
Don't tell anyone about this.

28:09.560 --> 28:10.920
If Dongfang Qingcang finds out,

28:11.000 --> 28:12.920
Lord Changheng will die.

28:13.000 --> 28:14.480
Don't worry. I won't say anything.

28:16.000 --> 28:17.960
But Lord Changheng

28:18.040 --> 28:20.000
should be in Shuiyuntian.

28:20.080 --> 28:21.320
Why is he in the Mortal World?

28:24.720 --> 28:26.360
I don't know.

28:26.440 --> 28:29.280
Maybe it has to do
with the former God of War.

28:30.280 --> 28:31.440
Wait.

28:32.240 --> 28:34.160
Who is the former God of War?

28:34.240 --> 28:37.240
Lady Wanqing, whom we saw today.

28:37.920 --> 28:40.520
I'm guessing she is the former God of War

28:40.600 --> 28:42.880
who sacrificed herself for Shuiyuntian.

28:42.960 --> 28:44.840
This is Lady Chidi's tribulation.

28:45.600 --> 28:46.800
Lady Chidi?

28:48.600 --> 28:50.480
I seem to have heard of this name.

28:51.800 --> 28:53.040
No, wait.

28:53.120 --> 28:55.800
But she died 30,000 years ago.

28:55.880 --> 28:56.920
How is she alive now?

28:57.880 --> 28:59.800
I don't know why.

28:59.880 --> 29:00.880
I only know

29:00.960 --> 29:03.280
that Dongfang Qingcang
might want her primordial spirit.

29:05.040 --> 29:07.160
Why does he want her primordial spirit?

29:07.960 --> 29:09.040
Whatever the reason,

29:09.120 --> 29:11.680
it must be bad for Shuiyuntian.

29:11.760 --> 29:13.200
Jieli, what should we do

29:13.280 --> 29:14.320
if it is true?

29:18.400 --> 29:19.720
Forget it. Don't worry about it.

29:20.200 --> 29:21.440
We'll figure it out later.

29:21.520 --> 29:22.880
Tomorrow is the Lantern Festival.

29:22.960 --> 29:24.240
We should have fun.

29:24.320 --> 29:25.400
The Lantern Festival?

29:29.800 --> 29:31.520
"The night of the Lantern Festival."

29:31.600 --> 29:33.400
"Meeting her beloved."

29:33.480 --> 29:34.800
The night of the Lantern Festival

29:34.880 --> 29:38.040
is when Xie Wanqing will meet

29:38.120 --> 29:39.360
her destined lover.

29:40.320 --> 29:41.360
That is tomorrow night.

29:41.960 --> 29:43.120
Her destined lover.

29:43.640 --> 29:44.560
That's right.

29:44.640 --> 29:45.720
Xiao Run and Xie Wanqing

29:45.800 --> 29:47.280
were engaged to each other.

29:47.360 --> 29:49.000
Today, he even proposed to her.

29:52.400 --> 29:54.320
Her destined lover is Lord Changheng.

30:00.600 --> 30:04.080
SPIRIT-SHATTERING ABYSS, XISHAN

30:13.480 --> 30:16.400
What time is it in Yunmeng Lake now?

30:18.120 --> 30:19.400
You haven't recovered.

30:20.120 --> 30:21.240
Don't act rashly.

30:28.840 --> 30:29.680
It's almost time.

30:31.360 --> 30:33.720
Lantern Festival, Yiyou Year.

30:53.920 --> 30:55.200
I'm going to keep her company.

31:25.320 --> 31:27.600
- Is this the Lantern Festival?
- Is this new to you?

31:27.680 --> 31:29.760
- We need to find Lady Chidi soon.
- It is.

31:30.560 --> 31:32.560
I want to watch her tribulation.

31:33.600 --> 31:34.840
Yes.

31:36.560 --> 31:37.520
There's an acrobatic show.

31:37.600 --> 31:38.760
Let's take a look.

31:38.840 --> 31:39.720
- All right.
- Don't go.

31:43.720 --> 31:45.080
What's so interesting about acrobats?

31:45.680 --> 31:48.800
Let's go and see mortals' magic.

31:50.880 --> 31:52.040
That's right.

31:52.120 --> 31:53.800
We should take a look around

31:53.880 --> 31:55.440
since we are here.

31:56.360 --> 31:58.160
I'll go and explore the way with Shangque.

31:59.120 --> 32:00.680
I'll go too.

32:01.280 --> 32:02.440
Don't.

32:02.920 --> 32:04.560
Why are you leaving?

32:04.640 --> 32:05.720
You stay here.

32:05.800 --> 32:07.720
Shangque and I can explore the way.

32:08.760 --> 32:10.800
- Let's go.
- Jieli.

32:10.880 --> 32:11.800
- Let's go.
- Jie…

32:25.520 --> 32:26.640
Come on.

32:29.080 --> 32:30.520
What are you looking at?

32:30.600 --> 32:31.760
Stupid Black Dragon.

32:31.840 --> 32:33.720
You've served him for over 30,000 years.

32:33.800 --> 32:35.480
Why are you still so clueless?

32:36.320 --> 32:37.280
What do you mean?

32:37.360 --> 32:39.000
The Lantern Festival is so lively

32:39.080 --> 32:40.240
with such beautiful sights.

32:40.320 --> 32:43.280
Don't you want the lord
to be alone with Orchid?

32:45.800 --> 32:47.040
But…

32:47.640 --> 32:48.760
Why don't we

32:49.320 --> 32:50.800
spend some time together?

32:54.400 --> 32:55.960
I don't want to be alone with you.

32:57.240 --> 32:58.520
We're exploring the way.

33:00.840 --> 33:02.040
Wait for me.

33:02.120 --> 33:03.240
Why are you leaving?

33:03.320 --> 33:04.400
Wait for me.

33:04.480 --> 33:05.440
Stop!

33:08.600 --> 33:10.040
Sir.

33:10.120 --> 33:11.000
Buy a flower.

33:11.080 --> 33:13.640
These freshly-picked lilies and peonies

33:13.720 --> 33:14.840
are all beautiful.

33:14.920 --> 33:16.560
They'll look even better
in the lady's hair.

33:18.080 --> 33:19.280
No, thank you, little girl.

33:19.360 --> 33:21.000
Sir, buy one.

33:21.080 --> 33:22.760
I wish you two
a union lasting a hundred years.

33:22.840 --> 33:24.120
Only a hundred years?

33:24.200 --> 33:25.080
If that is not enough,

33:25.160 --> 33:27.440
then thousands and millions of years.

33:28.000 --> 33:29.800
All right, I'll have one.

33:33.640 --> 33:34.840
Thank you, sir.

33:45.680 --> 33:46.760
Turn around.

34:06.480 --> 34:07.360
All right.

34:17.760 --> 34:18.600
I…

34:21.199 --> 34:23.000
I've just seen men in the Mortal World

34:23.080 --> 34:24.360
adorning women with flowers.

34:25.040 --> 34:26.719
Since we are to pretend to be mortals,

34:26.800 --> 34:28.360
we should act the part.

34:41.360 --> 34:42.199
Sir.

34:45.120 --> 34:46.440
Did you come to Lucheng

34:47.480 --> 34:49.199
just to relax?

34:50.280 --> 34:51.639
Or is there something else?

34:56.280 --> 34:57.400
Nothing else.

34:57.960 --> 34:59.200
Are you lying to me?

34:59.280 --> 35:00.440
No.

35:01.160 --> 35:02.360
I'm just here to relax.

35:11.560 --> 35:13.360
Why do you ask this?

35:16.080 --> 35:17.320
No reason.

35:17.400 --> 35:18.560
I just wanted to ask.

35:28.040 --> 35:29.280
Since you're so worried,

35:30.400 --> 35:31.280
I promise you

35:32.480 --> 35:34.440
I won't lie to you ever again.

35:37.800 --> 35:38.640
But

35:40.600 --> 35:42.040
don't lie to me again either.

35:44.400 --> 35:45.240
All right?

35:47.120 --> 35:48.240
All right.

35:49.280 --> 35:50.720
Cuju balls!

35:51.320 --> 35:52.880
Come and have a look!

35:55.560 --> 35:57.840
Sir, have a look.

35:57.920 --> 35:58.960
Buy one.

36:02.920 --> 36:04.480
Look at my Cuju balls.

36:04.560 --> 36:05.720
Sir, pick one.

36:07.520 --> 36:08.440
Take a look.

36:09.040 --> 36:10.240
Sir.

36:11.720 --> 36:12.800
Pick one.

36:44.960 --> 36:46.120
Come on!

36:46.200 --> 36:48.560
Place your bets.

36:48.640 --> 36:49.560
- Big!
- Small!

36:49.640 --> 36:51.120
- Big!
- Small!

36:51.200 --> 36:52.800
- Big!
- Hurry up!

36:52.880 --> 36:53.840
- Anyone betting on big?
- Big!

36:53.920 --> 36:55.200
- Big!
- Anyone betting on small?

36:55.280 --> 36:56.160
- Small!
- Big!

36:56.240 --> 36:57.400
Place your bets!

36:58.240 --> 36:59.680
One, two, three! Small!

37:01.400 --> 37:03.840
Mr. Xiao, thank you.

37:04.480 --> 37:05.880
Let's stop here.

37:05.960 --> 37:06.920
That's enough.

37:08.240 --> 37:10.600
Take a break
in the tea room on the second floor.

37:10.680 --> 37:11.760
No.

37:11.840 --> 37:12.800
Let's continue.

37:13.400 --> 37:14.880
If my memory serves me,

37:14.960 --> 37:17.520
you have no more money on you.

37:17.600 --> 37:19.040
Don't keep gambling.

37:19.120 --> 37:21.200
- Or you will be embarrassed.
- Come on, let's continue.

37:22.480 --> 37:24.800
- I'll bet big this time.
- Folks, place your bets!

37:26.840 --> 37:28.520
- Xiao Run, what are you doing?
- Big!

37:28.600 --> 37:29.760
- Cricket.
- Big!

37:29.840 --> 37:31.320
- How long have you been with me?
- Big.

37:32.120 --> 37:33.920
I lost my parents at a young age.

37:34.000 --> 37:35.640
Since you brought me back,

37:35.720 --> 37:37.240
I've been following you.

37:37.320 --> 37:38.760
It has been at least 11 years.

37:40.280 --> 37:41.120
Over the past decade,

37:41.200 --> 37:42.600
haven't we eaten and slept together?

37:43.600 --> 37:44.440
I'll open it.

37:45.000 --> 37:46.280
Didn't I treat you as my brother?

37:46.760 --> 37:48.120
Didn't I treat you well?

37:48.760 --> 37:50.440
Of course.

37:51.000 --> 37:52.400
Let's continue.

37:53.000 --> 37:54.560
My good brother.

37:54.640 --> 37:56.240
Lend me your allowance from last month.

37:57.520 --> 37:58.720
Any more?

37:58.800 --> 37:59.920
- I'll open it.
- One last time.

38:00.000 --> 38:01.720
It's really the last time.

38:02.360 --> 38:03.320
I'll pay 40% interest.

38:03.400 --> 38:04.280
Any more?

38:04.360 --> 38:06.040
- Any more?
- If not, then 50% interest.

38:06.920 --> 38:09.200
- Here!
- No, Xiao Run.

38:09.280 --> 38:10.560
You…

38:12.080 --> 38:13.840
Don't hesitate. Hurry up.

38:13.920 --> 38:15.240
You're such a slowpoke.

38:15.320 --> 38:16.480
- Take it out.
- Hurry up.

38:16.560 --> 38:17.720
I really can't.

38:19.160 --> 38:20.280
If you don't give it to me,

38:20.360 --> 38:22.040
I'll tell my father

38:22.120 --> 38:24.520
that you took me to go whoring,

38:24.600 --> 38:25.520
gambling, and drinking.

38:25.600 --> 38:26.480
Then he'll break your legs.

38:26.560 --> 38:27.720
Big or small?

38:28.880 --> 38:29.920
Give it to me.

38:30.000 --> 38:31.440
- I won!
- Come on!

38:31.520 --> 38:32.400
Give it to me.

38:37.480 --> 38:38.480
Hurry.

38:38.560 --> 38:40.040
Come on, I'm opening it.

38:41.720 --> 38:43.760
- Four, five, six. Big!
- Make way.

38:43.840 --> 38:45.200
- One more time.
- Big.

38:45.280 --> 38:46.720
Mr. Xiao.

38:46.800 --> 38:48.200
Do you think our gambling house

38:48.280 --> 38:49.680
is for charity?

38:50.880 --> 38:51.720
Take away your spare change.

38:51.800 --> 38:53.520
Don't play if you can't afford it.

38:54.800 --> 38:55.880
How is it not enough?

38:55.960 --> 38:58.040
I have spent a lot

38:58.120 --> 38:59.120
in your gambling house.

38:59.200 --> 39:00.840
The past is the past.

39:00.920 --> 39:03.360
Tonight's stakes
have been accumulated until now.

39:03.440 --> 39:05.640
Your spare change is not enough.

39:06.800 --> 39:07.680
All right.

39:09.920 --> 39:10.760
Go on and bet.

39:10.840 --> 39:12.160
I bet this.

39:12.240 --> 39:14.080
Xiao Run, let's just leave.

39:14.160 --> 39:15.440
Don't bet with the jade!

39:15.520 --> 39:16.640
It's none of your business.

39:16.720 --> 39:18.320
- Yes, it's a bother.
- Is this jade enough?

39:18.800 --> 39:20.480
Yes, it is.

39:20.560 --> 39:21.560
Come on.

39:22.440 --> 39:23.960
Come, place your bets!

39:24.040 --> 39:25.680
- Big or small?
- You can't use the jade!

39:25.760 --> 39:27.760
- Big.
- Big.

39:27.840 --> 39:29.960
One, two, three. Small!

39:30.640 --> 39:31.840
I gained!

39:31.920 --> 39:33.720
- Thank you, Mr. Xiao.
- Why did you lose again?

39:33.800 --> 39:35.280
Say, you put treasures on the line.

39:35.360 --> 39:36.760
I'll count to three.

39:36.840 --> 39:37.720
Grab it and run.

39:38.680 --> 39:40.160
One, two,

39:41.200 --> 39:42.320
three!

39:43.360 --> 39:44.240
Catch him!

39:44.320 --> 39:46.360
- Don't let him escape!
- Mine!

39:46.440 --> 39:47.920
Don't let him run away!

39:52.200 --> 39:53.480
Let's split up. See you at home.

39:55.600 --> 39:56.520
Catch them!

40:12.200 --> 40:14.680
You've been sitting here all night.

40:14.760 --> 40:16.720
Aren't you going to the lantern market?

40:17.680 --> 40:19.320
It's lively outside.

40:19.960 --> 40:22.400
There are many circuses and lion dancing.

40:25.560 --> 40:27.480
What a racket.

40:27.560 --> 40:28.880
It doesn't interest me.

40:30.200 --> 40:31.080
Then

40:31.160 --> 40:33.400
how about going back and having a rest?

40:33.480 --> 40:34.840
Don't catch a cold.

40:35.520 --> 40:36.600
I'm waiting.

40:38.440 --> 40:40.320
Who are you waiting for?

40:45.520 --> 40:46.440
I don't know.

40:48.960 --> 40:51.960
How long will you wait?

40:55.840 --> 40:57.160
I don't know.

40:59.640 --> 41:01.200
You must be drunk.

41:02.920 --> 41:03.840
My lady,

41:04.360 --> 41:06.920
you've enjoyed the moon and the wine.

41:07.000 --> 41:08.440
Go back and rest.

41:10.840 --> 41:12.120
I've seen everything

41:13.240 --> 41:14.720
in my life.

41:17.440 --> 41:20.160
Precious horses and priceless fur coats.

41:21.480 --> 41:24.640
I've experienced everything in the world.

41:28.040 --> 41:29.440
But I still feel

41:30.720 --> 41:32.160
that I'm waiting for something

41:32.960 --> 41:34.240
that I'm missing.

41:35.920 --> 41:39.720
Are you waiting for the perfect man

41:39.800 --> 41:41.320
who understands you?

41:45.720 --> 41:47.080
I don't know.

41:55.280 --> 41:56.120
My lady.

41:56.600 --> 41:58.200
Let's go back and rest.

42:12.680 --> 42:13.920
This music

42:15.160 --> 42:16.600
is what I've been waiting for.
